<title>USA: IMM currency futures end mixed, Swiss francs firm.</title>
<headline>IMM currency futures end mixed, Swiss francs firm.</headline>
<text>
<p>July 9 - IMM currency futures ended mixed after Swiss francs led an afternoon recovery that helped pull yen and marks off their lows, floor traders said. They said Sept Swiss ran stops above $0.6900 on way up. Sept marks bounced back to end near unchanged after setting another contract low at $0.5690 early.</p>
<p>((Chicago Derivatives Desk (312)408-8750))</p>
